set of garments is a family of garments, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 61, confer "means a set of garments composed of two or three pieces made up".
hosiery is a family of clothing accessories, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 61, confer "Panty hose, tights, stockings, socks and other hosiery".
