braces is a family of clothing accessories, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 62, confer "Brassieres, girdles, corsets, braces, suspenders, garters and similar articles".
other accessory is a family of clothing accessories, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 61, confer "Other made up clothing accessories".
part is a family of clothing accessories, as stated in HTSUS Chapter 61, confer "knitted or crocheted parts of garments or of clothing accessories".

